      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1330,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 55,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "text": "Late evidence remains admissible after task cancellation or planning-budget exhaustion. Recovery uses a separate bounded allowance.\nProposed design • not implemented. See docs/15 for identity, event admission, and delivery contracts.",
      "originalText": "Late evidence remains admissible after task cancellation or planning-budget exhaustion. Recovery uses a separate bounded allowance.\nProposed design • not implemented. See docs/15 for identity, event admission, and delivery contracts.",
